</section>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.5 </span>Ablation Study: Stability Analysis</h3>

<div id="S4.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To validate the necessity of each stabilization component, we conducted an ablation study on a representative subset that poses challenging structural constraints. We performed a three-way comparison—<em id="S4.SS5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Full SGA</em>, <em id="S4.SS5.p1.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Full SGA w/o Tuple-wise Optimization</em>, and <em id="S4.SS5.p1.1.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Full SGA w/o Scale-Adaptive Modulation</em>—and report the 1st-place rate (%) under both LLM Judge and Human Evaluation (<a href="#S4.T2" title="In 4.5 Ablation Study: Stability Analysis ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ The Quadratic Geometry of Flow Matching: Semantic Granularity Alignment for Text-to-Image Synthesis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Tab.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>).</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
