</table>
</figure>
<div id="Pt0.A6.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Pt0.A6.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Pt0.A6.SS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Note:</span> The GPU hours listed above are estimated values. In practice, we select the saved checkpoint closest to each target time point for evaluation, rather than training to the exact duration. The deviation between the estimated time and the actual checkpoint used does not exceed 30 minutes in any case.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="Pt0.A6.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">0.F.3 </span>Animagine XL 3.1 (SDXL U-Net) Training Configuration</h3>

<div id="Pt0.A6.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A6.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For the U-Net architecture experiments, we use Animagine XL 3.1 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib47" title="" class="ltx_ref">47</a>]</cite> as the base model. The full configuration is listed in <a href="#Pt0.A6.T5" title="In 0.F.3 Animagine XL 3.1 (SDXL U-Net) Training Configuration ‣ Appendix 0.F Full Experimental Setup ‣ The Quadratic Geometry of Flow Matching: Semantic Granularity Alignment for Text-to-Image Synthesis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Tab.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Pt0.A6.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="Pt0.A6.T5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 5</span>: </span><span id="Pt0.A6.T5.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Animagine XL 3.1 (SDXL) training hyperparameters.</span></figcaption>
