</section>
<section id="Pt0.A6.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">0.F.4 </span>Per-Domain Training Budget (SDXL)</h3>

<div id="Pt0.A6.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A6.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The same checkpoint selection protocol applies to the SDXL experiments. <a href="#Pt0.A6.T6" title="In 0.F.4 Per-Domain Training Budget (SDXL) ‣ Appendix 0.F Full Experimental Setup ‣ The Quadratic Geometry of Flow Matching: Semantic Granularity Alignment for Text-to-Image Synthesis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Tab.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> lists the estimated GPU hours per domain.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Pt0.A6.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="Pt0.A6.T6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 6</span>: </span><span id="Pt0.A6.T6.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Estimated GPU hours per domain (Animagine XL 3.1).<span id="Pt0.A6.T6.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The same checkpoint selection protocol as FLUX applies: actual models used are the closest saved checkpoints to the listed times, with deviation not exceeding 30 minutes.</span></span></figcaption>
