<section id="Pt0.A8" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix 0.H </span>Discussion: SGA in the Open-Source Diffusion Model Ecosystem</h2>

<div id="Pt0.A8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The open-source diffusion model community has evolved along two principal architectural lineages, each presenting distinct optimization characteristics that contextualize the practical relevance of SGA. <a href="#Pt0.A8.T7" title="In Appendix 0.H Discussion: SGA in the Open-Source Diffusion Model Ecosystem ‣ The Quadratic Geometry of Flow Matching: Semantic Granularity Alignment for Text-to-Image Synthesis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Tab.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> summarizes this landscape.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Pt0.A8.T7" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="Pt0.A8.T7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 7</span>: </span><span id="Pt0.A8.T7.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Open-source diffusion model ecosystem.<span id="Pt0.A8.T7.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Representative foundation models and their community-driven derivatives, organized by backbone architecture.</span></span></figcaption>
<div id="Pt0.A8.T7.6" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:31.7pt;vertical-align:-14.6pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-165.3pt,15.2pt) scale(0.510681860269947,0.510681860269947) ;">
<table id="Pt0.A8.T7.6.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="Pt0.A8.T7.6.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
