<figure id="algorithm2" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="algorithm2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span>SGA Training Loop with Dynamic Tuple Accumulation</figcaption>
<div id="algorithm2.6" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algorithm2.6.1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.6.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">
